<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>The Momma Whale 🐳</title>

  <style>
    * {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      box-sizing: border-box;
      font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
    }

    body {
      min-height: 100vh;
      background: 
        linear-gradient(
          rgba(0, 80, 160, 0.45),
          rgba(0, 80, 160, 0.45)
        ),
        url("https://i.postimg.cc/hvP8Wf9R/marveon.gif");
      background-size: cover;
      background-position: center;
      background-repeat: no-repeat;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      text-align: center;
      color: #eaf4ff;
    }

    .card {
      background: rgba(0, 40, 90, 0.55);
      backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
      padding: 28px 22px;
      border-radius: 18px;
      max-width: 420px;
      width: 90%;
      box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.35);
    }

    h1 {
      font-size: 2rem;
      margin-bottom: 6px;
    }

    .emoji {
      font-size: 2.2rem;
    }

    p {
      margin-top: 10px;
      font-size: 1rem;
      opacity: 0.95;
    }

    .ca-box {
      margin-top: 18px;
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.12);
      padding: 14px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      word-break: break-all;
    }

    .label {
      font-size: 0.7rem;
      letter-spacing: 1px;
      opacity: 0.8;
      margin-bottom: 6px;
    }

    footer {
      margin-top: 18px;
      font-size: 0.8rem;
      opacity: 0.85;
    }

    @media (min-width: 768px) {
      h1 {
        font-size: 2.4rem;
      }
      .card {
        padding: 34px 28px;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <div class="card">
    <div class="emoji">🐳</div>
    <h1>The Momma Whale</h1>
    <p>
      Cute. Calm. Massive.<br />
      A gentle giant of the meme sea.
    </p>

    <div class="ca-box">
      <div class="label">CONTRACT ADDRESS</div>
      7TBD7QD9kyzwADErHusNtVWzSBdtG8j4aYJuXadNpump
    </div>

    <footer>
      🌊 Just keep swimming
    </footer>
  </div>

</body>
</html>
